Package: parkeze-tailscale
Version: @VERSION@-@BUILD@
Depends: tailscale, ip-full, kmod-nft-core, kmod-nft-nat, ucode, ucode-mod-uci
Source: parkeze
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@parkeze.com>
Architecture: all
Description: Tailscale backhaul, pinned to the wired path.
 Joins the Parkeze tailnet using an auth key issued by parkeze.net at
 adoption, and confines all tailnet traffic to the ethernet WAN so that it can
 never fall back onto metered cellular.
